/P 75 0 R
/T (Log Read Behavior The system usesa d irect file-read approach. The backend reads threat_intel.json on every request,  including dashboard loads and /api/threats polling \(every ~5 seconds\). This ensures real-time accuracy and simplicity, with no cache synchronization overhead. For small datasets \(<10,000 logs\), disk I/O and JSON parsing remain efficient. However, performance may degrade as data volume increases due to repeated reads and parsing.)
/E (Log Read Behavior The system usesa d irect file-read approach. The backend reads threat_intel.json on every request,  including dashboard loads and /api/threats polling \(every ~5 seconds\). This ensures real-time accuracy and simplicity, with no cache synchronization overhead. For small datasets \(<10,000 logs\), disk I/O and JSON parsing remain efficient. However, performance may degrade as data volume increases due to repeated reads and parsing.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
