<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 75 0 R
/T (Static Asset Caching Flask serves static assets \(CSS, JavaScript\) with HTTP caching headers such as Cache-Control and ETag. This allows browsers to cache frontend resources, reducing bandwidth usage and improving load times. Only dynamic API data is fetched frequently.)
/E (Static Asset Caching Flask serves static assets \(CSS, JavaScript\) with HTTP caching headers such as Cache-Control and ETag. This allows browsers to cache frontend resources, reducing bandwidth usage and improving load times. Only dynamic API data is fetched frequently.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
