/Title (Healthcare Realism: Deceptive responses mimic real EHR systems \(e.g., "Epic Systems  DB: Access violation"\). Low Interaction: Honeypot does not emulate full services, reducing attack surface and risk. Concurrency Safety: Thread-safe log writing using mutex locks to prevent corruption under high attack volume. Observability: All threat intel stored as plain-text JSON for SIEM ingestion or manual  analysis. Resource Efficiency: Minimal CPU/memory footprint for deployment on edge devices or  low-resource healthcare IT environments.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1055 0 R
>>
endobj
